    # Determine suggestion following observation: suggests if somewhat close.
    # Ninja Spellchecker: it uses edit distance and requires distance <= len(word)//2 etc?
    # We approximate: find candidate with minimal distance; suggest if distance <= max(1, min(len(word), len(cand))//2?) 
